Author: Developer <max@local.dev>
Date:   Tue Oct 27 09:22:41 2026 +0800

    fix(metrics): close MAX-237 T1 review R1-R3
    
    R1: extract the accepted template contract byte-for-byte and import it
    instead of redefining synonymous schemas; keep only helpers and derived
    type aliases in the domain model.
    
    R2: a stable (template, item) identity can no longer switch to an
    incompatible canonical metric, unit or dimension key set — the guard is
    on the repository's conditional append, so a racing caller cannot bypass
    it.
    
    R3: the declared parameter type selects the validation branch, so a
    number can no longer satisfy a boolean/string parameter.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

